OL,3,GNEWSAPetition calls for speed bumps on
OL,4,Abusy city road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition which has more than 50 valid
OL,7,Fsignatures has called for speed bumps
OL,8,Fto be installed, to help ensure the
OL,9,Fsafety of children using the nearby
OL,10,Fschool and parks.
OL,12,FThe proposals will be discussed at a
OL,13,Fcabinet meeting at the council on
OL,14,FTuesday.
